Dual licensing

This repository uses two licenses, depending on what you are reusing:

1) Software (MIT)
   - Applies to: source code under scripts/ and requirements.txt
   - Full terms: LICENSE-MIT
   - SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT (for those files)

2) Documentation and images (CC BY 4.0)
   - Applies to: README.md, files under assets/, and other prose or imagery
     that is not source code listed above
   - Full terms: LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.txt
   - Human-readable summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   - When reusing the sample coaster photograph, credit Jackie Pease as
     described in README.md

If in doubt, ask the maintainers. Third-party tradenames (e.g. eufyMake) are
property of their respective owners.
